        "frame(q,L,R)=P(q,P(L,R)). leftFrame(q,L,R)=frame(q,L/2,L%2+2R) moves the numeric center to the previous cell.",
        "Left-step calculation: with L=prefix_b(n+1,l), raw left=prefix_b(n,l), right=b+2R. After writing b and moving left the raw tape is (prefix_b(n,l)/2, prefix_b(n,l)%2+2*(b+2R)), exactly leftFrame(q,prefix_b(n,l),2R+b).",
        "The right step shifts the scanned bit b to 2L+b and drains one right prefix bit. Both steps preserve entire arbitrary suffixes.",
        "Both induction predicates universally quantify both tape parameters and use total Delta1 function graphs; hence they are Pi1 and I\u03a31 Pi1 successor induction is legitimate. The changed-parameter IH needed after each step is present.",
